Crunchy kimbap
1
Simple kimbap with vinegared rice and tight rolling

---
rice|200|g
nori sheet|1|pcs
rice vinegar|15|ml
pickled radish|30|g
---
Cook the rice with a 1:1.5 rice-to-water ratio over low heat without stirring.
Let rest 10 min off the heat.
Season the warm rice with vinegar, salt and pepper.
Cut the fillings into thin sticks (5–6 cm long, 3–4 mm thick).
Spread rice and fillings on the nori sheet.
Roll firmly, pressing with your hands.
---
bento
rice
kimbap
